# Locked media files

These files are the working 1.1.20 playback/add path.

- `CleanPlayer.tsx`: Android → `CleanPlayerYoutubeIframe`. Do not route Android to `CleanPlayerMediaBridge`.
- `youtubeEmbedUrl.ts`: Android embed uses `www.youtube.com` + `autoplay=1`.
- `MainActivity.java`: `setMediaPlaybackRequiresUserGesture(false)` and third-party cookies on. No googlevideo interceptor.
- `channelStore.ts`: `requireAuthenticatedParentPin` returns null when the parental gate is already unlocked.

Layout/CSS around these files is OK. Changing attach/resolve/PIN-verify logic is not, unless the user asked for a playback bugfix.
